{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"乍得","country_iso":"TCD","created_at":"2026-03-23T11:02:34.222257","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"TCD-HB-0001","ldc":"Yes","location":"恩贾梅纳","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"乍得恩贾梅纳30MW光伏+20MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Chad N'Djamena 30MW PV + 20MWh BESS Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"天津电建","content":"11月28日，中国能建天津电建签署乍得恩贾梅纳30兆瓦光伏EPC项目全过程管理技术服务合同。\n据悉，该项目位于乍得首都恩贾梅纳市南部约5公里处，工程内容为新建一座30兆瓦光伏及20兆瓦时储能的光伏电站，项目工期为10个月，预计在2023年9月竣工。工程建成后将进一步缓解恩贾梅纳市区及周边地区用电压力，为当地百姓提供更多就业机会，大大改善当地生活、营商环境。\n该项目的签署，进一步提升了企业在光伏项目领域的整体业绩，是践行中国能建《若干意见》和“1466”战略，践行天津电建《行动纲要》和“135”战略，全面贯彻落实“1333”市场开发总方针，在“13384”市场文化引领下，严格落实“达成五个共识，掀起一场跑市场热潮”的相关要求的又一成绩。下一步，海外工程公司将凭借良好品牌形象和业绩口碑，多元化、精细化拓展非洲市场渠道，乘新能源在非洲兴起之势，把握脉搏，再创新成绩，为“2025年，再造一个新天津电建”的宏伟目标贡献力量。","content_sha256":"e9d3c00c7ea36b1d5fa1d65260f95bc2d1f14f2677a5bfb8a03a868363adc4d6","id":14756,"publish_date":"2022-11-29 21:43:02","title":"中国能建签约乍得恩贾梅纳光伏项目","title_sha256":"74a54a9cb171a0b5eb81acf712466c10118b86c43897cece3ad6d6fef29a3162","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/34526.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"TCD-HB-0001","capacity_details":"PV: 30MW, BESS: 20MWh","capacity_mw":30.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"30","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T11:02:34.222503","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"TCD-HB-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/11019_2525235.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Unknown","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":